<title>NETHERLANDS: HEINEKEN NET PROFIT DIPS IN 1996.</title>
<headline>HEINEKEN NET PROFIT DIPS IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    13.06 vs  13.24</p>
<p>    Net profit			   655    vs 664</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  3.50 vs   3.50</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		 12.19 vs  10.14</p>
<p>    Trading profit (billions)	  1.01 vs   1.01</p>
<p>    Tax charge			   369    vs 384</p>
<p>    Minority charges		    30    vs  31</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected Heineken NV, Europe's largest</p>
<p>brewer, to report a net of 630-660 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
